We are a corporate Bell mobility dealer located in Kensington. We have been awarded Bell’s Top Business Dealer Western Region of the Year for 2012, 2016 and 2017. Our team has over 70 years of combined experience, and is well-versed in providing the right mobility solutions for our clients. Our services include, but are not limited to,

Customized mobility solutions on the Bell Mobility network;
Exceptional deployment process for any size device rollout;
Enterprise-level billing management solution, including real-time usage tracking and alerts;
Fully-certified, local repair centre;
Device buyback program that provides value for used smartphones—we purchase smartphones from any Canadian carrier, and guarantee to erase all data to ensure compliance with ISO 27001 and the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act of Canada.;
Non-traditional and IoT (internet of things) solutions. 

Call us today 403-270-7070 or email us at info@umobi.ca.
